  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting Social Cohesion by Combatting Xenophobia and Anti-Migrant Sentiments Against International Migrants in the Kyrgyz Republic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to promote social cohesion and migrant-inclusive socio-economic growth by decreasing xenophobic and anti-migrant sentiments among the Kyrgyz host society and by increasing the safety of international migrants in Kyrgyzstan, especially students, through initiatives designed to enhance mutual positive perception. The project will take a whole-of-society and whole-of-government approach, involving beneficiaries, community associations, academic institutions, and government counterparts throughout all project stages.</narrative>
  </description>
